{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06349","headline":"寄万齐融 · 李颀","name":"寄万齐融","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名高不择仕，委世随虚舟。\n小邑常叹屈，故乡行可游。\n青枫半村户，香稻盈田畴。\n爲政日清净，何人同海鸥。\n摇巾北林夕，把菊东山秋。\n对酒池云满，向家湖水流。\n岸阴止鸣鹄，山色映潜虯。\n靡靡俗中理，萧萧川上幽。\n昔年至吴郡，常隐临江楼。\n我有一书札，因之芳杜洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06349.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06349","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}